{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b3e29adcd15fc77f84a24bd0616d1fee6c7e3a71ffbe4cb5921605ff0cce07cd", "ja": "劇場公演に向けてレッスンしている瑞希達。\nまだ始まったばかりなのに、妙に息が合う。\n何かがあった？　でも誰も思い出せない……\nひとまずは目の前の夢を叶えるため、公演を\n頑張ろうと誓い合うのだった。", "zh": "正在为剧场公演练习的瑞希等人。\n明明才刚刚开始，却意外地配合默契。\n是发生过什么吗？可是没有人想得起来……\n总之，为了实现眼前的梦想，大家互相约定\n要努力完成公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0e1b6adb5c8a4e71c0735928cba5c4191e74185d79e4b880aa8ac898d85cdd8d", "ja": "（ふー、危なかった。\nなんとか瑞希達のレッスンに間に合ったな！）", "zh": "（呼——好险。\n总算赶上瑞希她们的练习了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "ab46ae3edbd529ac06ab943817b5bcb1b10ec775d0ae08db1cc9833bc15a506f", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……。\nターン……決まりました。ぶい。", "zh": "一、二、三、四……\n转身……完成。耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "d39e53897788c49b4b42487b440f0c29fecb89aa0f8125beb119b428d216fb15", "ja": "OK、バッチリだな！\nへへっ、これならいいステージになりそうだ。", "zh": "OK，很完美嘛！\n嘿嘿，这样一来演出应该会很棒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "8d479bcf5c72bc51223d32912c24f9b8cede99b98a9eb6a67428ee71ee049022", "ja": "なんだか今日は、わたしたち……。\n不思議なくらい、息がピッタリですね♪", "zh": "总觉得今天我们……  \n默契得不可思议呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "e44eb3a531c0631e60ff08910d1919fd16f99c0de2f9db542858c7a93703b537", "ja": "そうだね。まだレッスン始まったばかりなのに、\nお互いの動きが、全部わかるような……。", "zh": "是啊。明明才刚开始训练，\n却好像能完全了解彼此的动作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ba6d83294f88bb63b7f9877be49b438ddfc911761daeabf5d589f3b00a60cd60", "ja": "わたしも、なんだか体が軽い～♪\nもっともっと、レッスンしたい気分かも！", "zh": "我也觉得身体不知怎么的变轻盈了～♪\n感觉还想继续练习呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1006_p", "source_sha256": "098dfd4078230c3f8f22ef799ebf04dfecabee9d9568f0b3675110a90863d622", "ja": "いや、そろそろ休憩だ。無理はよくないから。\nひと休みしたら、次は通しでやってみようか。", "zh": "不，差不多该休息了。勉强自己可不好。\n休息一会儿后，接下来要不要从头到尾完整来一遍？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6e2634139c4ee29a58fe5f755a0003f26e78a44bc18c0a49e494d8536abf1bb5", "ja": "はーい！　楽しみ～♪\nわたし、アドリブ入れてみてもいいですか？", "zh": "好～！我很期待哦～♪\n我可以试着加点即兴发挥吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "25cfa4a4e0d165e8d4a9e3755ee37ed8b47cf3cadeb087680f328ab27cace310", "ja": "ん～、まあいいんじゃないか？\n今なら、なんだか合わせられそうな気がするし♪", "zh": "嗯～，我觉得没问题吧？\n总感觉现在的话，应该能配合得上♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "3fc6fef494f5455e0c4c95b5da2d9cd1ac0c9fa97e4c5023be25ffcaf401388a", "ja": "私もです。新しいチャレンジを……。\n{$P$}、どうでしょう。", "zh": "我也是。关于新的挑战……{$P$}，您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9d2a721558d6ed083310b9d3051f99d073b09bef3a3e865f1a4cd8f70dadf2e3", "ja": "もちろん構わないよ。新しい世界を目指して、\nどんどんチャレンジしていこう！", "zh": "当然没问题。以全新的世界为目标，\n大胆地不断发起挑战吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "c640b2bccd65422e43ce3e0c2017e45b50177ff20b1536ca1fa2992bad473dcd", "ja": "……あの、ところで、{$P$}さん。\nこの前の、不思議な出来事のことですけど……。", "zh": "……那个，话说回来，{$P$}先生。\n关于前阵子发生的不可思议的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1012_p", "source_sha256": "96e91a17a031c0fed6c074c34506407d40958e207a1b4253016f01c1fb92a8b0", "ja": "ああ、みんな言ってたよな。\nうん、俺も体験した気がするんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，大家都提过这件事吧。\n嗯，我好像也亲身经历过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "941a3ef811fe0a55f4e03e934970bdaae0877af8b6c057671d15a2e390438f27", "ja": "不思議ですよね～。みんな何かあった気がしてるのに、\n誰も何も覚えてないって。", "zh": "真是不可思议呢～明明大家都觉得好像发生过什么，却谁都不记得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "bc2a0d64dd72a892f154692b894ec6afee3dac33e994738308a4ec14eb9fecc7", "ja": "でも、なんかめちゃくちゃ熱くなって、\nしかもロックだった気がするんだよな！", "zh": "但是，总觉得热血沸腾的，而且好像还是摇滚来着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "fc89986dbd8654d3eeefd30c099ec8f8e100fd6eebd988d931c14abaebe93a6d", "ja": "ふふっ。思い出せないのは、ちょっと残念だけど……。\nでも、いいのかもしれませんね！", "zh": "呵呵。虽然想不起这件事，让人有点遗憾……  \n不过，这样或许也不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "32f7806379ea102f87e6f0f364c6cacae6e553ede668406daed3ab37708ddcb4", "ja": "はい。私達は、どんな時でも夢を追いかけて、\nそして、かなえてゆく……アイドルですから。", "zh": "是的。因为我们是无论何时都追逐梦想，并将其逐一实现的……偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "454f9fdd715542fe2e4200e85494d1c5c8b5ad32b911869bce727dbd820b9bb4", "ja": "わ～！　瑞希ちゃん、前にどこかにいた時も\nかっこよかった気がするけど、今日もかっこいい～！", "zh": "哇～！瑞希之前在什么地方的时候好像也很帅，不过今天也很帅气～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1018_p", "source_sha256": "36a121c9ee2207ad1abb1c85339a303db77258153831b5a1fba37efde7e1bf5f", "ja": "ああ、瑞希の言うとおりだ。何があったのか気になる\nけど、みんなは自分の夢に向かって……ん？", "zh": "啊，正如瑞希所说。虽然很在意到底发生了什么，但大家都在朝着自己的梦想前进……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1019_se", "source_sha256": "8ab39c98b354b4c90079a04be042a686ff82e33ef4d4f826dadeab546caa166a", "ja": "ヴーッ、ヴーッ！", "zh": "呜——，呜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_08_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0df116a1d75be2c2d6751203b2141a439781b5481aae4969ef1699ee20ca6ed5", "ja": "っと、メールが届いてるな。\nあれ？　なんだこれ、差出人不明……？", "zh": "哦，有邮件发过来了。\n咦？这是什么，发件人不明……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
